      "content": "i know people say that, but it doesn't feel true. i see the way my mom looks at me when i mess up, or how my friends have to drop everything to help me through a crisis. it's like i'm just a constant drain on their energy. if i wasn't around, they'd finally be able to just breathe and live their lives without constantly worrying about me. it feels like the only way i can actually help them is by not being a factor in their lives anymore.",
